1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,559
Give an AI the same request for a web
page:

2
00:00:03,559 --> 00:00:08,500
why does one result look like a template,
and another like a designer's work?

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:10,874
The difference may be a single skill.

4
00:00:10,874 --> 00:00:15,045
This video introduces Anthropic's official
frontend-design skill.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:21,916
A skill is an operating manual written for
an AI Agent: how to handle a type of task,

6
00:00:21,916 --> 00:00:25,396
which rules to follow, and which tools it
can use.

7
00:00:25,396 --> 00:00:29,432
It's just a folder, and at its core is one
file, SKILL.md.

8
00:00:30,367 --> 00:00:32,373
You usually don't have to name it.

9
00:00:32,373 --> 00:00:36,977
The AI reads the description at the top of
SKILL.md to decide when to load it.

10
00:00:36,977 --> 00:00:40,104
To force it, type a slash followed by the
skill name.

11
00:00:41,067 --> 00:00:45,593
A skill can live in the project directory,
where it only applies to that project,

12
00:00:45,593 --> 00:00:48,834
or in your user directory, where every
project can use it.

13
00:00:48,834 --> 00:00:52,914
But a global skill may compete with the
project's skills to be triggered.

14
00:00:53,867 --> 00:00:59,863
Installing takes one line: npx skills add,
followed by the GitHub owner and repo.

15
00:00:59,863 --> 00:01:03,712
Add an at sign and a name to install just
one skill.

16
00:01:03,712 --> 00:01:08,080
Dash a picks the AI Agent, dash dash copy
copies the files,

17
00:01:08,080 --> 00:01:10,300
and dash y skips confirmation.

18
00:01:11,233 --> 00:01:13,466
Two things matter before you start.

19
00:01:13,466 --> 00:01:16,367
First, in Antigravity, use Open Folder to
open

20
00:01:16,367 --> 00:01:18,826
this unit's folder, not the outer one.

21
00:01:18,826 --> 00:01:22,527
Second, after installing a skill, always
start a new chat,

22
00:01:22,527 --> 00:01:24,505
or the skill won't take effect.

23
00:01:25,467 --> 00:01:29,964
frontend-design makes the AI work like the
design director of a studio:

24
00:01:29,964 --> 00:01:33,827
it finds the colors, fonts, and layout in
the subject itself,

25
00:01:33,827 --> 00:01:37,212
and deliberately avoids the AI-template
look of purple

26
00:01:37,212 --> 00:01:39,971
gradients, big numbers, and a row of
cards.

27
00:01:40,933 --> 00:01:45,500
Example one: ask the AI for a one-page
website for a Taiwanese artisanal

28
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:48,500
tea brand, Shanlan Tea Research
Institute,

29
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:52,823
with a brand story, three teas, an origin
map, and an order button.

30
00:01:52,823 --> 00:01:55,664
The key is the last line: no SaaS
template,

31
00:01:55,664 --> 00:01:59,957
and propose two aesthetic directions for
me to choose from first.

32
00:02:00,900 --> 00:02:05,077
Here's the home page it built: off-white
paper with tea brown,

33
00:02:05,077 --> 00:02:06,492
and a serif headline.

34
00:02:06,492 --> 00:02:09,355
On the right of the hero is a harvest
batch

35
00:02:09,355 --> 00:02:12,151
card showing altitude and roasting craft.

36
00:02:12,151 --> 00:02:15,317
The whole page reads like a tea field
notebook.

37
00:02:16,267 --> 00:02:21,224
Example two: a Memory Match game with Vite
and JavaScript: sixteen cards,

38
00:02:21,224 --> 00:02:25,841
a move count and a timer, and the page
running as soon as it's done.

39
00:02:25,841 --> 00:02:31,545
This prompt is almost the same as in Unit
01; the only difference is that this time,

40
00:02:31,545 --> 00:02:33,107
the skill is installed.

41
00:02:34,067 --> 00:02:37,681
Flipped cards turn white, and matched
pairs disappear.

42
00:02:37,681 --> 00:02:40,592
Put it side by side with the Unit 01
version

43
00:02:40,592 --> 00:02:43,436
and compare the colors, fonts, and layout.

44
00:02:43,436 --> 00:02:47,987
Finally, don't forget to ask: which Skills
did you use in this case?

45
00:02:48,933 --> 00:02:53,587
To recap: open the right folder, install
the skill, start a new chat,

46
00:02:53,587 --> 00:02:56,690
give the prompt, and ask which skills it
used.

47
00:02:56,690 --> 00:02:58,511
Now go and try it yourself.
